polyline><polyline points="13,14 17,14 " class="polyline" name="polyline" style="stroke: #2196f3; fill: none; stroke-width: 1px;"></polyline><g points="15,5 15,10" class="polyline" name="pin" type="simple" netid="5" netidpos="0"><polyline points="15,5 15,10 " style="stroke: rgb(255, 0, 0); stroke-width: 1px;"></polyline><rect width="6" height="6" class="pin" x="12" y="2" style="stroke: rgb(0, 255, 0); fill: none; stroke-width: 1px; display: none;"></rect><text r="0" x="13" y="12" transform="rotate(90 13 12)" style="font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; display: none;">p</text><text r="0" x="15" y="5" transform="rotate(0 15 5)" style="font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; display: none;"> </text><ellipse cx="15" cy="8.5" rx="1.5" ry="1.5" style="stroke: rgb(255, 0, 0); fill: rgb(255, 0, 0); stroke-width: 1px; display: none;"></ellipse><polygon points="13.5,10 16.5,10 15,11.5 " style="stroke: rgb(255, 0, 0); fill: rgb(255, 0, 0); stroke-width: 1px; display: none;"></polygon></g><polyline points="7,10 23,10 " class="polyline" name="polyline" style="stroke: #2196f3; fill: none; stroke-width: 1px;"></polyline></g><g x="355" y="55" transform="translate(355,55)" width="25" height="15" class="part" name="part" xo="0" yo="0" sref="X3" directory="std"><g width="150" top="572" left="0" height="150" zoom="20" symbol="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;GND&quot;,&quot;reference&quot;:&quot;X&quot;,&quot;device&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;std&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;GND&quot;}}"></g><polyline points="9,12 21,12 " class="polyline" name="polyline" style="stroke: #2196f3; fill: none; stroke-width: 1px;"></polyline><polyline points="13,14 17,14 " class="polyline" name="polyline" style="stroke: #2196f3; fill: none; stroke-width: 1px;"></polyline><g points="15,5 15,10" class="polyline" name="pin" type="simple" netid="6" netidpos="0"><polyline points="15,5 15,10 " style="stroke: rgb(255, 0, 0); stroke-width: 1px;"></polyline><rect width="6" height="6" class="pin" x="12" y="2" style="stroke: rgb(0, 255, 0); fill: none; stroke-width: 1px; display: none;"></rect><text r="0" x="13" y="12" transform="rotate(90 13 12)" style="font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; display: none;">p</text><text r="0" x="15" y="5" transform="rotate(0 15 5)" style="font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; display: none;"> </text><ellipse cx="15" cy="8.5" rx="1.5" ry="1.5" style="stroke: rgb(255, 0, 0); fill: rgb(255, 0, 0); stroke-width: 1px; display: none;"></ellipse><polygon points="13.5,10 16.5,10 15,11.5 " style="stroke: rgb(255, 0, 0); fill: rgb(255, 0, 0); stroke-width: 1px; display: none;"></polygon></g><polyline points="7,10 23,10 " class="polyline" name="polyline" style="stroke: #2196f3; fill: none; stroke-width: 1px;"></polyline></g><text class="draggable" name="text" x="30" y="18" r="0" rtemp="0" transform="rotate(0 30 18)" style="fill: rgb(255, 123, 0); font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; font-size: 14px; font-family: lighter;">Tunnel diode oscillator</text><text class="draggable" name="text" x="60" y="47" r="0" rtemp="0" transform="rotate(0 60 47)" style="fill: rgb(100, 116, 139); font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; font-size: 9px; font-family: lighter;">Vb</text><text class="draggable" name="text" x="150" y="47" r="0" rtemp="0" transform="rotate(0 150 47)" style="fill: rgb(100, 116, 139); font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; font-size: 9px; font-family: lighter;">X</text><text class="draggable" name="text" x="228" y="47" r="0" rtemp="0" transform="rotate(0 228 47)" style="fill: rgb(100, 116, 139); font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; font-size: 9px; font-family: lighter;">D</text><g transform="translate(30,280)" x="30" y="280" width="420" height="230" class="analysis" name="analysis" description="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Time Domain&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;dcsweep&quot;:{&quot;param&quot;:&quot;Non&quot;,&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;start&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;stop&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;step&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;modified&quot;:false},&quot;time&quot;:{&quot;start&quot;:&quot;0s&quot;,&quot;stop&quot;:&quot;2us&quot;,&quot;step&quot;:&quot;0.2ns&quot;,&quot;modified&quot;:false},&quot;ac&quot;:{&quot;start&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;stop&quot;:&quot;1000&quot;,&quot;step&quot;:&quot;100&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:&quot;dec&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;de&quot;,&quot;modified&quot;:false},&quot;yAxe&quot;:[{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;D&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#2a73c0&quot;},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;X&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#d33636&quot;}],&quot;xAxe&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;None&quot;,&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#000000&quot;,&quot;used&quot;:false},&quot;layout&quot;:{&quot;margin&quot;:{&quot;l&quot;:35,&quot;r&quot;:25,&quot;b&quot;:80,&quot;t&quot;:35},&quot;font&quot;:{&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#333333&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:11,&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;},&quot;paper_bgcolor&quot;:&quot;#ffffff&quot;,&quot;plot_bgcolor&quot;:&quot;#f8f8f8&quot;,&quot;bordercolor&quot;:&quot;#cccccc&quot;,&quot;yaxis&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;linear&quot;,&quot;gridcolor&quot;:&quot;#e0e0e0&quot;,&quot;showgrid&quot;:true},&quot;xaxis&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;linear&quot;,&quot;gridcolor&quot;:&quot;#e0e0e0&quot;,&quot;showgrid&quot;:true},&quot;showlegend&quot;:true,&quot;grid&quot;:{&quot;rows&quot;:1,&quot;columns&quot;:1,&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;independent&quot;,&quot;roworder&quot;:&quot;bottom to top&quot;}},&quot;options&quot;:{&quot;uic&quot;:true,&quot;adaptive&quot;:true,&quot;order&quot;:2},&quot;sweep&quot;:{&quot;param&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:&quot;[]&quot;}}"><foreignObject x="0" y="0" width="420" height="230"><div name="plots" style="border-style: double; transform-origin: 0px 0px; transform: scale(0.6); box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 3px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: 700px; height: 383.333px;" ondblclick="showPlotInModel(this)"></div></foreignObject></g><g transform="translate(470,20)" x="470" y="20" title="codeHTML" width="560" height="839" class="codeHTML" name="codeHTML" rot="0"><foreignObject x="0" y="0" width="560" height="839" style="width: 560px; height: 839px;"><div name="htmlCode" style="zoom: 0.56; height: 1498.21px; width: 1000px;" code="&lt;div class=&quot;ch&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Tunnel Diode Oscillator&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;ch-card&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Circuit Components&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supply (Vb):&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;TrapezoidVoltage&lt;/em&gt;, 0 V &amp;rarr; 0.25 V in 1 ns at t = 0 (then constant). The fast switch-on is the kick that starts the oscillation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resistor (Rl):&lt;/strong&gt; 5 &amp;Omega;, the losses of the coil and of the supply&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inductor (L):&lt;/strong&gt; 1 &amp;micro;H&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capacitor (C):&lt;/strong&gt; 100 pF, in parallel with the diode&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tunnel diode (TD):&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;TunnelDiode&lt;/em&gt;, I&lt;sub&gt;p&lt;/sub&gt; = 5 mA at V&lt;sub&gt;p&lt;/sub&gt; = 0.1 V, junction capacitance C&lt;sub&gt;j&lt;/sub&gt; = 10 pF. The anode is on the node &lt;em&gt;D&lt;/em&gt; and the cathode on ground&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Principle&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The current of a tunnel diode is the sum of three terms. The tunnel term has a peak, the excess term makes a valley, and the ordinary diode term takes over at high voltage:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ch-formula&quot;&gt;
$I(V) = I_p \dfrac{V}{V_p}\, e^{1 - V/V_p} \;+\; I_x\left(e^{K_{ex}(V - V_x)} - e^{-K_{ex} V_x}\right) \;+\; I_s\left(e^{V/V_t} - 1\right)$
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Between the peak and the valley the current &lt;strong&gt;decreases&lt;/strong&gt; when the voltage increases: the diode has a negative resistance. Rl and L bias it in the middle of this region (V&lt;sub&gt;b&lt;/sub&gt; = 0.25 V). There the diode acts as a negative conductance &amp;minus;g that cancels the losses of the tank formed by L and C.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;ch-grid&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ch-col blue&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;I(V) of the diode&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Peak: &lt;strong&gt;0.100 V, 5.00 mA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valley: &lt;strong&gt;0.430 V, 1.15 mA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ratio I&lt;sub&gt;p&lt;/sub&gt; / I&lt;sub&gt;v&lt;/sub&gt; = &lt;strong&gt;4.3&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negative resistance from 0.10 V to 0.43 V&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Steepest slope: &lt;strong&gt;&amp;minus;18.2 mS&lt;/strong&gt; (&amp;minus;55 &amp;Omega;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ch-col red&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Start-up condition&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The oscillation grows if the negative conductance is larger than the losses of the tank&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$|g| &gt; \dfrac{R_l (C + C_j)}{L}$&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Here: &lt;strong&gt;18.2 mS &amp;gt; 0.55 mS&lt;/strong&gt;, so it starts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The amplitude stops growing when the curvature of I(V) makes the average negative conductance equal to the losses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Results of the Simulation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ch-formula&quot;&gt;
$f_{LC} = \dfrac{1}{2\pi\sqrt{L (C + C_j)}} \approx \mathbf{15.2\ MHz}$ &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; $f_{sim} \approx \mathbf{12.2\ MHz}$ &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; $V_D:\ 0 \rightarrow \mathbf{0.54\ V}$
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The frequency of the simulation is &lt;strong&gt;12.20 MHz&lt;/strong&gt;. An independent integration of the two equations of the circuit with SciPy (Radau method) gives &lt;strong&gt;12.19 MHz&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The small-signal formula gives 15.17 MHz. The oscillation is large, so the formula is only a first estimate of the real frequency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The diode voltage goes from &lt;strong&gt;0.000 V to 0.541 V&lt;/strong&gt; in steady state, the same in the SciPy reference (the difference of the swing is 0.01 %)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The voltage on the diode is not a sine wave: its swing (0 to 0.54 V) is larger than the negative-resistance region (0.10 V to 0.43 V), so the waveform is distorted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Reading the Plot&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D&lt;/strong&gt;: the voltage on the diode and on C. The 1 ns step of the supply is a strong kick: the first swing already reaches 0.5 V after 45 ns, and the same oscillation continues up to 2 &amp;micro;s&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;X&lt;/strong&gt;: the voltage between Rl and L. In steady state it stays between 0.218 V and 0.256 V (a ripple of about 38 mV), because the coil blocks the high-frequency current. The current of the coil is &lt;em&gt;(V&lt;sub&gt;b&lt;/sub&gt; &amp;minus; X) / R&lt;sub&gt;l&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/em&gt;, between about 0 and 6.5 mA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;How to Run It&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ch-card&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0;&quot;&gt;Press &lt;strong&gt;Start Analysis&lt;/strong&gt; in the analysis block (Time Domain, 0 to 2 &amp;micro;s, step 0.2 ns). The options &lt;em&gt;uic&lt;/em&gt; (start from zero energy in L and C), &lt;em&gt;adaptive&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;order 2&lt;/em&gt; are already set in the block.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Things to Try&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ch-card&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the supply &lt;em&gt;V1&lt;/em&gt; of Vb to 0.05 V or to 0.6 V: the bias point is outside the negative-resistance region and the voltage on D settles to a constant (0.034 V and 0.56 V): no oscillation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase Rl to 50 &amp;Omega; or to 200 &amp;Omega;: the drop in Rl moves the bias point out of the negative-resistance region (D settles at 0.048 V and 0.010 V) and the oscillation does not start&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase C to 400 pF or L to 4 &amp;micro;H: the frequency goes down (the period is proportional to &amp;radic;(L C)); the amplitude stays about the same, 0.52 V and 0.54 V&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draw the limit cycle: add &lt;em&gt;L.I&lt;/em&gt; (the current of the coil) to the outputs and set &lt;em&gt;D&lt;/em&gt; as the x axis. The steady state is a closed curve in the (V, I) plane&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
"> 
